            "Verify automated headless container test execution via scripts/e2e-container.sh"
          ],
          "overview": "Deep dive into the autonomous InfinityAIAgent (qa_player/infinity_ai_agent.py): 140px spatial threat radar, 200px pack alerting, combined-arms tactics (tank intercept, rogue standoff kiting, wizard Magic Missile priority, cleric Cure Wounds <40% HP), and headless Xvfb :99 execution with 1080p FFmpeg video proof-of-work.",
          "quiz": [
            {
              "answer": "140px proximity trigger with 200px pack alerting radius",
              "options": [
                "Instant global aggro upon scene enter",
                "50px melee range only",
                "140px proximity trigger with 200px pack alerting radius",
                "500px entire viewport scan"
              ],
              "question": "At what proximity distance does the Infinity AI Agent threat radar trigger hostile combat detection?"
            },
            {
              "answer": "When any companion drops below 40% maximum Hit Points",
              "options": [
                "On round 1 regardless of health",
                "Only after all enemies are dead",
                "Only when the Cleric itself is attacked",
                "When any companion drops below 40% maximum Hit Points"
              ],
              "question": "In combined-arms AI tactics, when does the Cleric cast Cure Wounds during active combat?"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Module 4: Autonomous Infinity AI Agent & Headless BDD Verification"
        },
        {
          "durationMinutes": 10,
          "id": "mod-05-kgraph-architecture",
          "labSteps": [
            "Inspect .robos/kgraphs/crpg/package.jsonld entity declarations and relationship edges",
            "Run node packages/crpg-builder/bin/crpg-builder.js validate to test SHACL constraint shapes",
            "Execute node packages/crpg-builder/bin/crpg-builder.js generate to inspect generated GDScript data stores"
          ],
          "overview": "Learn RobOS Knowledge Graph-First game architecture: W3C SHACL shape validation (CRPGGameShape, CRPGMonsterShape, CRPGSpellShape), the 4-Phase Generation Pipeline, compiling JSON schemas in schemas/v1/ to typed GDScript DataStoreV1.gd singletons, zero hardcoding rule, and dual-state branch diffing.",
          "quiz": [
            {
              "answer": "Provides static type safety, autocompletion in Godot editor, and eliminates runtime KeyError crashes",
              "options": [
                "Allows the game to bypass Godot engine lifecycle hooks",
                "Provides static type safety, autocompletion in Godot editor, and eliminates runtime KeyError crashes",
                "Enables multiplayer networking over WebSockets",
                "Compresses textures and sound files into binary blobs"
              ],
              "question": "What is the primary benefit of compiling game data from JSON Schemas into typed GDScript singletons (DataStoreV1.gd)?"
            },
            {
              "answer": "Broken dialogue tree references, missing sprite asset bindings, and monster stat imbalances",
              "options": [
                "Syntax errors in Python packages",
                "Network packet loss during multiplayer matchmaking",
